n\nThe lower bound (3) and the explicit construction coincide; therefore the minimum possible number of tiles is \\(2n-2\\).  \nFor the given board \\(n=2025\\),\n\n\\[\n2n-2 = 2\\cdot2025-2 = 4050-2 = 4048 .\n\\]\n\nThus the answer is  \n\n\\[\n\\boxed{4048}.\n\\]"
